<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY TWO-YR GOVT BOND YIELD DROPS TO 23.34 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY TWO-YR GOVT BOND YIELD DROPS TO 23.34 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on</p>
<p>the latest issue of Hungary's two-year government bonds was set</p>
<p>by auction at 23.34 percent, down from 25.49 percent at auction</p>
<p>four weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on</p>
<p>Thursday .		 1998/K BOND</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     7,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     25.587.50 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    8,750 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 9,625 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    23.34 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     99.05 pct</p>
</text>
